WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.020
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.770
She went to an audition for the part of a shampoo's image character, but...

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.820
...she met a very spiteful girl there.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.190
The girl's name is Wakamatsu Madoka.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.900
For some ulterior motive...

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.810
...she seems to hold a grudge on <i>Full Moon</i>. {edited}

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:17.450
So much that... she put up a huge fuss over the results of the audition.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.240
Ah.. for heaven's sake!

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.990
I just want to kick her in the head!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:03.960
For this commercial...

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.260
<i>Full Moon</i>-san and Wakamatsu Madoka-san...

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.760
We're counting on you.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.390
What's with that?

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.640
Madoka-san.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.230
I'm so glad I get to work with you!

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.440
Let's do our best together!

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.190
Please, just choose one of us!

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:20.770
What?

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:47.300
That's cause... {Oh geez, the moe act}

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.930
...<i>Full Moon</i>-san's image doesn't go well with mine!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.890
I'm really worried! {Madoka is a really worried!, she says}

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:55.520
Can we really make a good commercial?

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:59.230
Like such a weak performance ever gonna deceive anyone! {edited}

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.270
Hmm...

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.230
That is true. {That weak act worked}

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:01.900
Ah!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.240
Valg... got a sec?

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.110
Well...

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.740
Like I said... the image I want is...

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.070
But for the characters in a commercial...

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:12.000
...they're totally different.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.870
That's why.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:14.590
Um...

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.910
If you would just calm down...

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.250
I'm sure something will...

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.000
Erm... sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.810
We have come to a conclusion.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.870
We will have a camera test for both of you the day after tomorrow.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:45.230
After that... we will be able to 
make our final decision.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:46.490
Eh?!

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.980
Which means...

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.000
...accordingly...

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.030
We will choose one person over the other.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.410
Thank you very much.

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:01.940
What?

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:03.420
Well that must suck. {edited}

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.750
That's all you have to say?

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.920
No "Wakamatsu Madoka's horrible!" or...

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.400
"Meroko's so cute!"? {shani: what does it have to do with you being cute?! Oh! Meroko! <3}

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.160
Well...

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:11.760
Not really...

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:12.680
Geez!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.060
We're working so hard!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.810
Say something else!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:20.310
Didn't I already say that it sucks?!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.270
Not that!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.730
Geez!

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.530
Something with more feeling!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:28.030
Huh?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.440
Do you have a fever? {Sorta}{shani: XD}

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.070
A cold?

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.030
That's not it!

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:33.490
'Cause... your face is totally red.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.120
This is... you know...{edited}

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.090
Yep.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:38.370
It's totally red.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:40.580
Takuto?

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.580
Y-Yours was too! {Back in episode 15, ohohoho}

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:43.100
Huh?

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:45.000
Never mind.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.380
Where are you going Takuto?

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.380
I'm coming too!{edited}

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:48.840
Bathroom.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.840
Don't follow me.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.060
The bathroom?!

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.140
Shinigami don't need to use the bathroom! {Why does this line reming me of Shirokuma Cafe... lol}

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.720
Something must be wrong with Takuto.

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.650
It's like he's mad about something...

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:00.140
Eh?

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.740
I need to cool myself down...

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:12.200
Losing a hold of myself like that... I just...

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:16.160
I'll have to shape up so her audition will go well.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.580
Maybe Takuto...

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.080
...really is against me being in a commercial, huh?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:20.870
Why?

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:21.880
That's cause...

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.330
Takuto was a singer before he died, right? {Way to go, Mitsuki, you spilled the beans}

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.640
"Commercials are absolutely 
useless for musicians!"...

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.110
...might be what he's thinking.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:31.380
Hey, Meroko.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.800
Do you know what kind of songs Takuto sang?

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:40.020
Takuto used to be a singer...

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.430
Where did you find that out?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.230
Eh?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.560
Um...

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:47.400
Takuto said that he used to sing when he was a human...

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.280
Why you stupid little kid! {alpha time is distracting in this case}

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.140
Why the hell are you talking about that for?!

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:55.160
But...!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.840
You think it's fun to poke around people's pasts?!

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:00.740
Besides, something like that has nothing to do with you!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.250
Did you really tell her, Takuto?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.210
That's...

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.120
Why did you tell her something like that?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.330
Even worse... to a human...

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.210
It's my choice to make!

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.420
Choice, you say?! {edited}

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.580
Takuto, what do you mean?

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.620
It's not supposed to mean anything!

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.070
Get out of my way.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.000
I'm talking to her right now.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.180
I'm talking to you too, Takuto!

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:21.560
Get out of the way!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.470
No!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:23.980
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.890
I said too much...

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:29.400
I was just wondering what kind of 
songs Takuto sang...

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:30.730
Ah!

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.150
Takuto!

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:36.670
Hold it, Takuto!

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:37.490
I'm not done talk...

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:38.620
Takuto!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.300
Takuto!

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.710
If something happens to Takuto...

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.170
...it'll be because of you!

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:49.710
Eh?

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.040
You know... Takuto's wings...

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.440
...are still just replicas.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:53.880
Re-Replica?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.340
It means that they were made...

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:56.680
They're not real.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:58.930
Takuto isn't official yet...

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.440
He hasn't become a full-fledged Shinigami yet.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.680
He's still in training.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.550
This kind of thing is the most dangerous for him.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:09.220
If he remembers everything from when he was a human...

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.440
...his soul will be trapped!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.150
Eh?!

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.400
Do you understand?

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.150
Without a body to go back to...

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.610
...he'll become a ghost!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:17.570
Ah!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.160
If you understand...

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:27.250
...don't ever say anything that will make Takuto remember his past again!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.250
Meroko...

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.630
Meroko!

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.510
What should I do?

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.720
I've done something terrible...

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:46.850
Ah.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.920
The two of them didn't come back...

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:05.840
Meroko...

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.000
Takuto...

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.580
Mitsuki-san?

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.420
Mitsuki-san?

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:18.970
Ah!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:19.840
Ah... yes!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:20.800
Ah!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.260
I'm sorry!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.590
You seem kind of tired, Mitsuki-san.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.490
I believe that...

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.980
...you are supposed to attend school today.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.650
If it's too much, rest in the hospital.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:34.580
Ah. That's okay.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.230
I'm fine.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:45.700
I'll be fine, right?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.020
Before tomorrow's audition...

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:50.180
...Takuto will definitely come back.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:50.910
Ah.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:52.460
Takuto? {No, just your bespectacled friend}

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.460
Tomoe-chan...

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:56.590
Who's Takuto?

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.100
Ah... um... that's... well...

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.640
Well, now... that's the name of the person you like, isn't it?

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.180
Eh?!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.590
I-It's not!

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.470
Don't hide it! Don't hide it!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.560
Come to think of it...

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.130
You seem so grown up suddenly...

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.770
In just two weeks of summer vacation...

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.170
Did something happen?

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.850
Nothing at all, I said!

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.340
Then who is this Takuto?

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.360
Takuto is...

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:18.530
Ah.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.200
Takuto is a very dear friend to me! {edited}

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.080
Are you okay?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:33.960
Oh crap!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.580
What are you guys doing?!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.060
Okay.

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:46.510
Looks like it finally dried.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.470
Thanks, Tomoe-chan.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.180
What's wrong?

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:58.160
It's nothing.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.650
Those boys...

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.360
I'll use my fist...

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:02.900
...and knock them out good!

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:04.570
It's okay.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:05.860
You don't have to do that...

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.730
You can't go easy on them.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.130
They did something wrong.

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.830
They're supposed to apologize.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.250
I see.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:14.830
You're right.

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:17.540
Thank you, Tomoe-chan!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.250
Mi-Mitsuki...

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:23.970
I'm home!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:25.550
Takuto?

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:26.430
Meroko?

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.640
They haven't come back yet...

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.480
Even though I wanted to apologize...

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:37.190
Hello? {phone end conversation, scale accordingly}

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.690
Ah. Mitsuki.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:40.300
Are you watching the TV right now?

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.220
Which means that...

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.490
...the character for the new Mermaid Tear commercial at the center of attention...

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:51.390
...will be chosen from Wakamatsu Madoka-san here and <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:51.920
Yes.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.540
To be mentioned with <i>Full Moon</i>-san...

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.290
It's an honor.

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:56.550
Huh...

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:59.760
It looks like Wakamatsu Madoka's 
agency set this up. {edited}

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:04.260
They're doing this to give her 
an advantage tomorrow.

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:07.120
But... it won't do any good, so it's okay.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:11.720
The one who's supervising, Kuahara-san, won't let that change his impressions.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:14.470
Please tell us how you feel about participating with the new star!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.140
Okay...

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.140
Yes!

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:16.520
In this audition...

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:20.270
...I hope to learn many things from <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.990
"Congratulations, Madoka-san." {Her mocking voice is not half-bad}

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:33.580
Here you go.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:36.660
I appreciate this, but...

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.120
...something like this won't 
change the image I have.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.210
That aura she has...

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.630
<i>Full Moon</i>  is the only one... who possesses that, I believe.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:46.550
No, no.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:47.630
That wasn't our intention.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:48.760
It's just that...

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:51.970
Yesterday, Madoka was so nervous... her teeth were chattering...

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.810
I thought that I could find out just how much of a chance she really has.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:57.850
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:11:59.690
Ah!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.270
Madoka-chan?!

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.230
Hey... are you okay?

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:04.880
Owie!

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.380
I messed up again! {shani: 10/10 for this acting! She really did it here!}

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:11.280
Please excuse her.

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:13.580
She let her nervousness get to her again. {edited}

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:14.160
No...

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:18.450
Madoka-chan seems like a much more straightforward girl than I thought...

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:22.630
The perseverance our Madoka has... is really heartwarming...

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.770
No... it's quite surprising!

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.960
Your clients must have seen some unexpected things as well.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:28.760
Oh, no!

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.090
I'm embarrassed!

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:57.000
Takuto...

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.060
The pendant Eichi-kun gave me...

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.180
Eichi-kun...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:20.770
I said something that hurt a very important friend of mine...

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.190
So... to help us be friends again...

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.270
...please lend me your power.

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:31.660
Eichi-kun...

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:52.800
Is it okay for you to not go?

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:56.100
The audition's tomorrow, right?

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.860
She doesn't have any work today.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:00.870
Then... is it just the two of us today?

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:01.910
Ah! I'm so happy!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.490
Let's go have some fun!

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.080
Just forget about yesterday, 'kay?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.540
She's really pitiful today, huh?

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.760
She can't do anything at all without you around.

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:18.160
She should just be a good girl 
and think about her Eichi-kun.

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:19.800
Right, Takuto?

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.470
You're so annoying, Meroko.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.300
Can't you leave me alone for a while?

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.180
Takuto?

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.010
Takuto...

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:12.010
Takuto...

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:14.280
Why aren't you coming?

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.130
Even though I want to apologize...

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.400
Ice cream's definitely the way to go in the summer.

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:24.670
Madam's going to be home late today...

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.300
I can take things easy... {missing line}

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:26.750
Hmm?

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:28.990
Mitsuki-chan.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.040
What is she doing over there?

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:37.740
Mitsuki-chan!

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:41.550
Mustn't forget!

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:44.550
Mitsuki-chan?!

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.760
Mitsuki-chan!

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:58.360
Dr. Wakaouji!

00:16:58.690 --> 00:16:59.490
How's Mitsuki..?!

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:02.100
She's running a high fever...

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.320
It doesn't look too good.

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:08.360
It'd be best for her to stay under critical watch at the hospital for the time being.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.290
Madam!

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.970
Even when I told her not to...

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.230
She still went walking around on her own...

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.430
She's all I have...

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.010
Eh?

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.650
My daughter...

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:30.430
Hazuki's child is all I have left.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:33.250
Even if she's that man's child...

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.400
...she is still my granddaughter.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.860
What I went through when I lost my daughter...

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:42.360
I already have too many painful memories!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.220
Where... am I...?

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.610
When did it become morning?

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:12.230
I have to get going!

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:48.840
The day's finally here.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.160
She isn't using the whistle anymore...

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.350
She's probably given up, right?

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:55.100
You know...

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.810
I've been thinking...

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:58.640
If it's come to this...

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.990
I can just tell the Shinigami head office to call you back.

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:05.320
That will probably be for the best.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:08.760
Let's see...

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.780
The procedure for these situations is...

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:12.960
She isn't the kind of person who'd give up.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.340
Takuto...

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.300
You can't be...

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:19.700
She's waiting.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:21.760
I can't just leave her on her own.

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:23.880
Takuto!

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:25.260
Hold it!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.960
Reversed letters again.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:32.640
Madam!

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:34.740
Mitsuki-chan...

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.570
Mitsuki-chan isn't in her room!

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.000
I have to hurry...

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.960
I even rushed back here...

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.630
Where has she gone off to?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.460
Man...

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.130
Meroko.

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.840
I won't let you go.

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:10.150
What are you fooling around for?!

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:11.800
Look at this.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:13.470
This is...

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.170
Yes.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.730
There's another message about something which will speed up her death.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.850
And... that keyword is...

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:21.400
Audition.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.400
That's why...

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:24.980
You can't transform her...

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:27.730
...and help her go to the audition!

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:28.360
But...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.070
We're Shinigami, remember!

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:35.130
We're here to make sure she lives as long as she's supposed to!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.550
I know that!

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:37.580
No, you don't!

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.920
You don't understand at all, Takuto!

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.800
Don't concern yourself with that girl anymore. {start time changed}

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.660
I...

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.590
For you to be with that girl...

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.760
I can't stand it anymore!

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:54.440
I didn't want to say this, but...

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.640
You and that girl...

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:58.680
...are somehow seem to be related.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.610
If you get any closer to her...

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.150
...it'll bring back your memories from when you were a human.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:07.360
You know what will happen, right?

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:14.030
I love you... {This would be more touching if it wasn't revealed that she's done this over 50 times already}

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:19.200
I want to be with you forever...

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:23.370
I don't want you to become a ghost, Takuto...

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:06.770
Wait, Mitsuki.

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:08.190
I'm going to find you.

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:09.080
Takuto...

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:11.360
Why do you keep on getting involved with her?

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:12.530
I don't understand it myself!

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:13.640
But...

00:23:13.640 --> 00:23:15.280
...I can't just leave her alone!

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:15.810
No way!

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:17.280
I won't let you go!

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:19.740
Takuto... because you've been with that girl this whole time...

00:23:19.740 --> 00:23:21.240
...we have a huge problem on our hands now!

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:22.200
Get out of the way, Meroko!

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.880
I don't care what happens to me!

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:24.700
I'm...

00:23:24.700 --> 00:23:26.990
I'm going to save Mitsuki!

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:29.670
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:31.210
Run! To the Audition!
